  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 7 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 3 * 7\n\nAccording to the question, by replacing the *signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷, −, +, ×, = \n\n7 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 3 * 7 ⇒ **7 ÷ 5**__ − 4 + 2 × 3 = 7\n\n1.4 − 4 + __**2 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 7\n\n__**1.4 + 6**__ - 4 = 7\n\n__**7.4 - 4**__ = 7\n\n3.4 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : +, −, ÷, −, = \n\n7 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 3 * 7 ⇒ 7 + 5 − **4 ÷ 2**__ − 3 = 7\n\n__**7 +**____** 5**__ − 2 − 3 = 7\n\n__**12 − 2 −**____** 3**__ = 7\n\n**7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, +, ÷, +, =\n\n7 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 3 * 7 ⇒ **7 ÷ 5**__ + __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 3 = 7\n\n__**1.4 + 2 + 3**__ = 7\n\n6.4 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : −, ÷, +, ×, =\n\n7 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 3 * 7 ⇒ 7 − **5 ÷ 4**__ + 2 × 3 = 7\n\n7 - 1.25 + __**2 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 7\n\n__**7 + 7**__ - 1.25 = 7\n\n__**14 - 1.25**__ = 7\n\n12.75 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
